{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51968","headline":"嵩山观（题吕岩） · 吕岩","name":"嵩山观（题吕岩）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两日行山兴尚稠，尘缘未断且回头。\n一天风雨吹凉阁，四面藤萝伴客留。\n着眼尽难爲业障，平生无过是浮沤。\n何须底死言名利，寻得清闲即便休。\n（同上三十《潼川州·遂宁县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}